			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				369a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. πρὸς τὰς ἐπιθυμίας οἱ νέοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1389a6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				32.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.312
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικιλώτατος καὶ ἁ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					41
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἁ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁψικορία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cal.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.214
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
